- Renamed the project, the Home Assistant domain (tibber_local -> pulse_bridge),
  the package directory, modules, classes, unique-id prefixes and the release
  archive; new icon and logo images in custom_components/pulse_bridge/brand/.
- custom_components/pulse_bridge/bridge_client.py (was tibber_client.py):
  WebSocket hardening, parsing and error handling, authentication and
  not-found errors.
- custom_components/pulse_bridge/__init__.py: re-authentication, repair issue,
  clean unload, firmware switch at runtime; legacy migration removed.
- custom_components/pulse_bridge/config_flow.py: re-authentication step,
  unique-id handling, input normalisation.
- custom_components/pulse_bridge/sensor.py, binary_sensor.py, const.py,
  manifest.json, translations/*.json: naming, state handling, texts.
- tests/, pytest.ini, requirements_dev.txt, .github/: tests, CI, templates.
- All documentation (README.md, docs/, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
  SECURITY.md, SUPPORT.md) rewritten or newly written.
